# user-supplied SRO archives — never committed
*.pk2

# Cursors decoded from the user's own PK2s stay out of the tree by default.
# The four below are ours (AI-generated, see .raw/Cursors.png) and ARE tracked,
# so they are exempted explicitly rather than left contradicting this rule.
#
# A crop that is loaded at startup but NOT exempted here is invisible twice
# over: it works on the machine that made it and is silently absent from every
# clone. That is how `cursors/Cursor14.png` shipped as a
# `bevy_asset: Path not found` line on every start. `CURSOR_IMAGES` in
# client/src/plugins/cursor/mod.rs is the list that must match this one, and
# `every_cursor_image_is_shipped` is the test that checks it.
cursors/*.cur
cursors/*.png
!cursors/Cursor3.png
!cursors/cursor_attack.png
!cursors/cursor_talk.png
!cursors/cursor_targeting.png
